# Only the built page, its PWA files and the data it loads belong here.
# Deny everything, allow by name. Tooling in the parent directory has written stray
# state into this checkout before, and a 1.5 MB database reached a public repo.
# deploy.py asserts that everything it wrote is tracked, so a missing entry here
# fails the deploy rather than silently 404-ing in the browser.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!manifest.webmanifest
!sw.js
!icon.svg
!search.json
!themes/
!themes/*.json
!text/
!text/*.json
!text-jps/
!text-jps/*.json
